What is an Embedding?
Embeddings convert text into numerical vectors that capture the semantic meaning of the 
text. A vector database stores these embeddings and enables similarity searches, allowing 
the system to retrieve relevant document chunks based on meaning rather than exact keyword 
matches.

You can think of an embedding as:
A mathematical representation of meaning

