The two biggest reasons we don't send the entire 500-page PDF are:

1. Context Window Limit

Every LLM has a maximum amount of text it can process at once.

Think of it as:

GPT Memory Buffer

Even the large models have limits.

A 500-page PDF might contain:

200,000+ words

which is often far beyond what we can send in a single prompt.

2. Efficiency & Accuracy

Imagine asking:

How do I export a STEP file?

and sending:

500 pages

to the model.

The model now has to search through:

Vehicle Design
Mesh Optimization
Rendering
Materials
Lighting
VR Setup
Export Options
...

to find one answer.

That's expensive, slow, and can actually reduce answer quality.

Instead we do:

Question
↓
Retrieve 3-5 relevant chunks
↓
Send only those chunks
↓
Generate answer

Now the AI focuses only on:

STEP Export Section

which produces better answers.

